{
  "slug": "doc-authoring-skills",
  "name": "Doc Authoring Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for authoring and reviewing technical documents: ADRs, CLAUDE.md, project docs, and independent document review with structured evaluation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `review-docs` (Independent document reviewer), `write-adr` (Create Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) to document technical decisions with context, alternatives, and consequences), `write-agent-instructions` (Create or update coding agent instruction files (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md)), `write-html-docs` (Create human-facing HTML documentation (diagram-rich overviews, rendered detailed specs) from canonical Markdown), `write-project-docs` (Standards for creating and updating project documentation (architecture.md, roadmap.md, security-design.md, etc.))\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install doc-authoring-skills@claude-community` from `naokami3/ai_dotfiles` (`plugins/doc-authoring-skills`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
